        "guards",
        "ephanna"
      ],
      "context_support_ratio": 1.0,
      "failure_surface": "synthesis_gap",
      "stage_loss_tokens": {
        "bonogo": "evidence_gap",
        "caelynn": "evidence_gap",
        "thalia": "hit",
        "wolf": "hit",
        "guards": "hit",
        "ephanna": "evidence_gap"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The fight in the Council Chamber involves the Players, the Wolf, Thalia, and multiple Guards; no explicit confirmation of council members being present in the projection.\n\nBased on OBSERVED and CANON facts, the following are actually present:\n\n- Players (group): Actively engaged in the confrontation, influencing the council and participating in the battle.\n- the Wolf: Central adversary, explicitly noted as being in the Council Room and initiating/participating in the conflict.\n- Thalia: Present with the Wolf (\u201cWolf is standing at Thalia\u2019s shoulder\u201d), initially serving him and later acting in combat.\n- Guards: Multiple guards are present or arriving as reinforcements; some are actively fighting, and others are positioned around the chamber.\n\nNotably absent:\n- Council members are referenced indirectly (players recounting their story, influencing deliberations), but there is no explicit statement confirming their presence during the fight itself in this projection.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Geography: Large circular chamber with central table, high ceilings, hidden trapdoor.\n- Defenses: Illusory walls, magical wards, rune activations affecting combat.\n- Atmosphere: Fireball-lit, tense, disheveled, with reinforcements being drawn in.\n- Operational Activity: Active combat, guard reinforcements, illusion effects, and escape attempts by the Wolf.",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_longmont_campaign_general_notes_1",
      "question": "Who are the Shepherds, and what god or power do they answer to?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "shepherds",
        "maelthor",
        "cult"
      ],
      "semantic_must_hits": [
