      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: Merril handles food and agriculture, Torrin represents the craft guilds, and Rurik oversees city infrastructure and structural integrity.\n\nMerril Tealeaf  \n- Job on Council: Representative of Agriculture and Food Production (CANON), Leader of the Agricultural Union (OBSERVED)  \n- Focus: Food supply safety, agriculture, and cleansing tainted food\n\nTorrin Flamescale  \n- Job on Council: Representative of the Guilds / Craft Guilds (OBSERVED), Master Smith  \n- Focus: Craftsmanship, guild interests, and practical city concerns\n\nRurik Stonehammer  \n- Job on Council: Representative of Infrastructure (CANON), Chief Architect (OBSERVED)  \n- Focus: City structure, defenses, tunnels, and structural integrity\n\nKey Attributes  \n- Governance Roles: Merril (food/agriculture), Torrin (guilds/craft), Rurik (infrastructure)  \n- Titles: Merril (Union Leader), Torrin (Master Smith), Rurik (Chief Architect)  \n- Responsibilities: Merril (food safety), Torrin (guild representation), Rurik (city integrity and layout)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_battle_with_the_wolf_and_aftermath_1",
      "question": "When the council-chamber fight ends, where does that leave the Wolf-dead, fled, what?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
