      "answer": "TL;DR: The Council Room was heavily disrupted\u2014**almost the entire room is lit up by Fireball**, its magical defenses activated, and the space left **disheveled** with illusion effects altering the layout.\n\nDuring Session 12 (OBSERVED):\n- A major explosion occurred: **\u201calmost the entire room is lit up by Fireball,\u201d** indicating widespread blast damage or at least intense magical impact across the chamber.\n- The room\u2019s defenses **changed state**: runes along the walls activated when Caelynn cast her spell, and **illusory walls** became part of the battlefield.\n- The environment became unstable and confusing due to these illusions and magical effects.\n- The overall condition degraded to **disheveled**, reflecting physical and/or magical disruption after the fight.\n\nNo explicit mention confirms structural destruction (like the table or ceiling collapsing), but the combination of Fireball and active defenses clearly altered both the room\u2019s condition and how it functioned during the encounter.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Physical Condition: Disheveled (OBSERVED)\n- Atmosphere: \u201calmost the entire room is lit up by Fireball\u201d (OBSERVED)\n- Defenses: Activated wall runes; Illusory Walls in effect (OBSERVED)\n- Geography: Hidden trapdoor present (no confirmed change)",
